import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 579 | Quest Domain | Condensed-Origin Realm Adaptation — Experience Sedimentation of the Inner Circuit","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 579 | Quest Domain | Condensed-Origin Realm Adaptation — Experience Sedimentation of the Inner Circuit","no":579,"module":3,"tags":["Quest Sediment Domain","Condensed-Origin Realm","Inner Circuit","Experience Sedimentation","Realm Adaptation"],"related":["501-Dual-Track Time Domain Overview","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","15-Energy-Cycle-and-Transformation Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0579_模块3-求索域-凝元境适配.md","filePath":"en/0579_模块3-求索域-凝元境适配.md"}'),a={name:"en/0579_模块3-求索域-凝元境适配.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,c,d){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-579-quest-domain-condensed-origin-realm-adaptation-—-experience-sedimentation-of-the-inner-circuit" tabindex="-1">Entry 579 | Quest Domain | Condensed-Origin Realm Adaptation — Experience Sedimentation of the Inner Circuit <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-579-quest-domain-condensed-origin-realm-adaptation-—-experience-sedimentation-of-the-inner-circuit" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 579 | Quest Domain | Condensed-Origin Realm Adaptation — Experience Sedimentation of the Inner Circuit&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 15; Benchmark library: Entries 568, 578</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-after-the-inner-circuit-is-built-you-must-move-in" tabindex="-1">Introduction: after the inner circuit is built, you must &quot;move in&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-after-the-inner-circuit-is-built-you-must-move-in" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: after the inner circuit is built, you must &quot;move in&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The acceleration domain designs &quot;fast trial-and-error, slow solidification&quot; for Condensed-Origin; the Quest Sediment Domain focuses on another matter: after the inner circuit is built, the cultivator must in slow time truly <strong>&quot;move into&quot; it</strong>. A built inner circuit, if only run through and tested in the acceleration domain, is still a separate skin from the cultivator&#39;s personality; only by running it, feeling it, adjusting it day after day at real flow does it truly become part of the cultivator&#39;s body.</p><p>Six top-level axioms continue here: anti-predation axiom requires experience sedimentation not be &quot;devouring others&#39; circuit experience,&quot; but one&#39;s own real experience; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires sedimented experience open to Myriad Ranks; collective ascension axiom requires inner-circuit daily insights returned to Alaya; causal self-discipline axiom requires the sedimentation period remain in contact with real causality; law-first axiom takes &quot;Condensed-Origin Quest Gear&quot; as a law clause, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-the-inner-circuit-needs-to-move-in" tabindex="-1">I. Why the Inner Circuit Needs to &quot;Move In&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-the-inner-circuit-needs-to-move-in" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why the Inner Circuit Needs to &quot;Move In&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The inner circuit is not a machine that once built is done, but a <strong>living symbiotic system</strong>. It mutually affects the cultivator&#39;s emotions, diet, sleep, relationships. A circuit run through in the acceleration domain may backfire in real life due to one argument, one sleepless night. The Quest-Domain Condensed-Origin Gear&#39;s task is to let the cultivator live long-term at real flow, observe the inner circuit&#39;s performance in various life situations:</p><ul><li>When emotionally agitated, is the circuit stable?</li><li>When fatigued, does the circuit leak?</li><li>When deeply interacting with others, does the circuit resonate?</li></ul><p>These questions cannot be measured in the acceleration domain, because there is no real life there.</p><h2 id="ii-quest-domain-condensed-origin-gear-parameters" tabindex="-1">II. Quest-Domain Condensed-Origin Gear Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-quest-domain-condensed-origin-gear-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Quest-Domain Condensed-Origin Gear Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Explanation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Recommended Flow</td><td>0.5–1×</td><td>Close to reality</td></tr><tr><td>Trial Period</td><td>3–10 real years</td><td>Enough to cover the full life cycle</td></tr><tr><td>Core Task</td><td>Daily operation, situation recording, micro circuit adjustment</td><td>No breakthrough pursuit</td></tr><tr><td>Experience Product</td><td>Inner-Circuit Life Journal</td><td>Records circuit performance in various situations</td></tr><tr><td>Exit Standard</td><td>Journal passes Alaya review</td><td>Not &quot;circuit stronger,&quot; but &quot;circuit more mature&quot;</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This parameter&#39;s essence is &quot;living life.&quot; The cultivator in Quest-Domain Condensed-Origin Gear is not &quot;cultivating,&quot; but &quot;living&quot; — he must work, socialize, face joys and sorrows, while observing how his inner circuit operates through all this. His life journal is his cultivation result.</p><h2 id="iii-the-life-journal-s-myriad-rank-value" tabindex="-1">III. The Life Journal&#39;s Myriad-Rank Value <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-life-journal-s-myriad-rank-value" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Life Journal&#39;s Myriad-Rank Value&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The inner-circuit life journal is a treasure the acceleration domain can never produce. A cultivator spending ten years recording &quot;what happened to my circuit when heartbroken,&quot; &quot;when helping others,&quot; &quot;when erring&quot; — these records&#39; value to Myriad Ranks far exceeds a technique blueprint:</p><ul><li>It tells later-comers the inner circuit is not cold topology, but flesh-bound to life;</li><li>It helps Myriad Ranks understand the real relation between &quot;energy and emotion&quot;;</li><li>It provides raw material for psychological healing, cultivation-ethics research.</li></ul><p>The Alaya Network compiles these journals into &quot;Myriad-Rank Cultivation Life Studies,&quot; required reading for all cultivators. This is precisely collective-ascension axiom&#39;s expression in everyday life: <strong>your daily life can also become Myriad Ranks&#39; textbook.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-opposition-to-closed-door-dead-practice" tabindex="-1">IV. Opposition to &quot;Closed-Door Dead Practice&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-opposition-to-closed-door-dead-practice" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Opposition to &quot;Closed-Door Dead Practice&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the predatory-faction system, Condensed-Origin&#39;s typical path is closed-door: lock oneself in a cave, ten years not seeing people, only practicing the circuit. This approach&#39;s problems:</p><ol><li>On exiting closed-door, collapses at the first real-life encounter, because the circuit has not withstood life&#39;s test;</li><li>The closed-door practitioner disconnects from society, cultivation becomes escaping reality;</li><li>It trains &quot;shut-in strong ones,&quot; not &quot;life strong ones.&quot;</li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou in Quest-Domain Condensed-Origin Gear makes &quot;life&quot; the core requirement: pure closed-door forbidden, must run the circuit in real life. This rule makes &quot;closed-door dead practice&quot;彻底 lose on the experience ledger.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: let the circuit be matured in life, avoiding later collapsing in actual combat due to life fluctuations</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: experience all from one&#39;s own life, not devouring others&#39; experiences</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style Condensed-Origin relies on closed-door ascetic practice, disconnected from life; Heng Yuan&#39;s Condensed-Origin requires maturing the circuit in life</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five lineages each have &quot;life&quot; forms; mechanical race&#39;s &quot;social life,&quot; consciousness race&#39;s &quot;conceptual life&quot; also included</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: life-journal library, recording methods, review standards all public; this is the everyday segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="vi-ethical-review-of-inner-circuit-life-journals" tabindex="-1">VI. Ethical Review of Inner-Circuit Life Journals <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-ethical-review-of-inner-circuit-life-journals" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Ethical Review of Inner-Circuit Life Journals&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Portions of life journals involving others must be anonymized: no recording neighbors&#39; real names, no exposing others&#39; privacy. The Alaya Network automatically reviews journals; unanonymized content is sent back. This protection lets cultivators dare run the circuit in real life, without worrying their cultivation records become tools of privacy violation. Causal self-discipline axiom here protects ordinary people around the cultivator.</p><h2 id="vii-quarterly-sharing-sessions-for-life-journals" tabindex="-1">VII. Quarterly Sharing Sessions for Life Journals <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-quarterly-sharing-sessions-for-life-journals" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Quarterly Sharing Sessions for Life Journals&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cultivators in Quest-Domain Condensed-Origin Gear attend a quarterly life-journal sharing session: everyone gathers, reads aloud the most felt journal passage of the quarter, comments on each other. Sharing is not assessment, but mutual inspiration — one person&#39;s inner-circuit problem may be a pit another once stepped in. Sharing sessions are anonymously hosted by the Alaya Network, protecting privacy while promoting real exchange.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Condensed-Origin&#39;s Quest Gear tells cultivators: the inner circuit is not finished once built; you must live it into maturity in life. <strong>A circuit stable through heartbreak, helping others, erring, is the circuit truly yours.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./568_模块3-加速域-凝元境适配.html">568-Acceleration-Domain Condensed-Origin Adaptation</a> · <a href="./578_模块3-求索域-感元境适配.html">578-Quest-Domain Sense-Origin Adaptation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy-Cycle-and-Transformation Law</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const p=i(a,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
